Subject: [PATCH 7/8] refactor(control-plane): move API key generation to its
 own module

"python -m forgemesh.controlplane.auth keygen" printed a runpy
RuntimeWarning on every run: the package __init__ imports app, which
imports auth, so the module was already loaded before runpy executed it
as __main__. Move the CLI to forgemesh.controlplane.keygen, which nothing
imports, and drop the now-redundant subcommand:

    python -m forgemesh.controlplane.keygen --tenant acme --subject ci-bot
